NextInOrderModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Returns the next in-order (order) block that has not been emitted yet, or null when out of range. A CFG traversal iterator in sequence order.
    Provides: NextInOrder(state, bid) -> res. bid is the current id; returns the id of the next unemitted block from state["order"] or null.
    DependsOn: IndexOf (index of bid in order), InList (emitted check).
    Composition: Native include from modules/GenWasm/GenWasm.sir (Path: ../NextInOrder/NextInOrder.sir).
    Notes: used by Reaches to continue traversal outside explicit transitions.
